OL,3,GNEWSAPolice using drones to monitor
OL,4,Anight-time city
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpotting a man at risk of falling in a
OL,7,Friver and keeping an eye out for
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour were among the
OL,9,Fuses officers found for drones, a
OL,10,Fpolice force has said.
OL,12,FDurham police has been flying drones in
OL,13,Fand around Durham city centre on
OL,14,Fweekend night-times to aid officers on
OL,15,Fthe ground, the force said.
OL,17,FThe patrols are now set to continue in
OL,18,Fthe run up to the busy festive season,
OL,19,Fa spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
