OL,3,GNEWSAPolice using drones to monitor
OL,4,Anight-time city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said drone use across its
OL,7,Fpatch, which covers from the Durham
OL,8,Fcoast down to Teesdale, was constantly
OL,9,Fexpanding, with drones deployed almost
OL,10,F1,800 times in the last year.
